Once you've downloaded a WP story as EPUB using [WP Downloader](/), you'll need an app or device to read it. Here are the best options for every platform.

## iOS (iPhone & iPad)

### Apple Books (built-in) - recommended
Apple Books is pre-installed on every iPhone and iPad. Tap an EPUB file and it opens immediately. Supports adjustable fonts, themes, and offline reading.

**How to open**: Tap the downloaded EPUB → Open in Books.

### Kindle app
The Kindle app on iOS doesn't open EPUB directly, but you can [send the EPUB to your Kindle via email](/help/how-to-send-wattpad-stories-to-kindle/) and read it in the app.

## Android

### Moon+ Reader - recommended
Moon+ Reader is a full-featured EPUB reader with customisable fonts, themes, and text-to-speech. The free version covers everything most readers need.

**Download**: Google Play Store → "Moon+ Reader"

### ReadEra
ReadEra supports EPUB, PDF, and many other formats. Clean interface, no ads in the free version.

### Google Play Books
Google Play Books can import EPUB files and syncs your reading progress across devices.

**How to import**: Open Google Play Books → Library → Upload → select your EPUB file.

## E-readers

### Kobo - best dedicated e-reader for EPUB
Kobo devices support EPUB natively without any conversion. Transfer files via USB or the Kobo desktop app.

**How to transfer**: Connect Kobo via USB → copy EPUB to the `Books` folder.

### Kindle
Kindle now supports EPUB natively (since late 2022). Send EPUBs to your Kindle using [Amazon's Send-to-Kindle service](/help/how-to-send-wattpad-stories-to-kindle/).

### PocketBook
PocketBook e-readers support EPUB directly. Transfer via USB or Wi-Fi sync.

## Desktop (Mac / Windows / Linux)

### Calibre - recommended for power users
Calibre is a free, open-source e-book manager that opens EPUB files, lets you convert between formats, and manages your entire library. Excellent for organising large WP story collections.

### Thorium Reader
Thorium Reader is a clean, modern EPUB reader built on the same standard as major publishing tools. Free and open-source. Available for Windows, Mac, and Linux.

## Quick start
1. [Download your WP story as EPUB](/wattpad-to-epub/) using WP Downloader.
2. Transfer or share the file to your preferred app.
3. Start reading offline.
